	(text "DRIVE IO (record sections 11-12; SPEC: 3.3 V RS485 non-isolated, quadrature via 74AHCT125, JST\n  GH signals).\nConnectors are the operator's: every off-board net ends in a named label (DRV_*, and +5V_SYS\n  for the drive's 485_5V on comms pin 10; PU-/DIR-/COM are GND).\nU9 THVD1450 on a P4 UART in RS485 half-duplex mode, DE and /RE tied. R23 termination fitted-\n  not-populated. D601 SM712 (-7/+12 V RS485 ESD) at the cable end.\nU10 on +5V_SYS (stamp pad 39, live on USB alone): TTL-threshold inputs take 3.3 V GPIO, 5 V out\n  to the opto inputs. Spare gates 3-4 disabled.\nStatus: WR alarm, RDY/PF following error, ZO encoder index are opto NPN to COM: 10k pull-up to\n  +3V3_SYS, 1k series into the P4 pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
